{"id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-program-envelope.md","title":"df program envelope","display":"df program envelope","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-program-envelope","aliases":["72-df-program-envelope"],"display":"df program envelope","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","[[72-df-inductive-definition]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§3.1–3.3, print650–653/PDF662–665; fixed-base formulation","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note by complete-lattice least-prefixed-point argument","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-program-envelope"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-program-envelope</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df program envelope"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf103f8baf1db1b8\" href=\"?note=bf103f8baf1db1b8\" title=\"72-df-inductive-definition\">72-df-inductive-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§3.1–3.3, print650–653/PDF662–665; fixed-base formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note by complete-lattice least-prefixed-point argument"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>签名、有限程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P\">\\(D_R^P\\)</span> 与四值求值分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a>。固定非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_0\\in D\">\\(d_0\\in D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_C:C\\to D\">\\(I_C:C\\to D\\)</span> 以及函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_F\">\\(I_F\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\">\\(I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\\)</span>。这些共同分量在下列全部结构中保持相同。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>，固定互异变量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_R\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec x_R\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P(\\vec x_R)\">\\(D_R^P(\\vec x_R)\\)</span> 使用上游的确定实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span> 是关系解释族的乘积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span> 则是完整四元结构的集合，二者由下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Str}_D\">\\(\\operatorname{Str}_D\\)</span> 明确联系，不作对象类型的隐式转换。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^M\">\\(R^M\\)</span> 取四值结构的关系分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\sqsubseteq N\">\\(M\\sqsubseteq N\\)</span> 取同一基底上的逐坐标信息序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 在右侧是上游四值格的下确界，允许空族。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{R,\\vec d}\">\\(s_{R,\\vec d}\\)</span> 是以下式指定的全赋值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(D_R^P(\\vec x_R))\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(D_R^P(\\vec x_R))\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R)\\)</span>；因此该公式的值只依赖列出的坐标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_P,\\operatorname{Adequate},I_P\">\\(\\mathcal E_P,\\operatorname{Adequate},I_P\\)</span> 在固定基底及变量序列后使用省略参数的记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)&amp;:=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Str}_D(J)&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J\\rangle,\\\\\nK_\\Sigma(D)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{Str}_D(J):J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\\},\\\\\nU&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\bigl(R\\mapsto(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathsf u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)&amp;:=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Str}_D(J)&amp;:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J\\rangle,\\\\\nK_\\Sigma(D)&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{Str}_D(J):J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\\},\\\\\nU&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\bigl(R\\mapsto(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathsf u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_{R,\\vec d}(v):=\\begin{cases}\nd_{\\iota i&lt;a_R(R)\\ (v=x_{R,i})},&amp;v\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R),\\\\\nd_0,&amp;v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_{R,\\vec d}(v):=\\begin{cases}\nd_{\\iota i&lt;a_R(R)\\ (v=x_{R,i})},&amp;v\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R),\\\\\nd_0,&amp;v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_P(M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto⟦D_R^P(\\vec x_R)⟧_{M,s_{R,\\vec d}}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P&amp;:K_\\Sigma(D)\\to K_\\Sigma(D),\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&amp;:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&amp;=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_P(M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto⟦D_R^P(\\vec x_R)⟧_{M,s_{R,\\vec d}}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P&amp;:K_\\Sigma(D)\\to K_\\Sigma(D),\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&amp;:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&amp;=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX§3.2.1–3.2.3给出envelope与充分结构的前不动点条件；本书随后§3.3用超限迭代得到最小充分结构。公式单调性使E_P单调；前不动点族非空（顶结构在其中），完备格最小前不动点证明与72-df-inductive-definition的两次单调性论证相同，故I_P为最小不动点。本节点固定基底，未将不同论域的结构作同一格内的比较。本节点的Adequate仅定义envelope的前不动点；对应原书的充分结构还须满足CET。实际身份等号不自动保证CET，例如两个不同常元可以同指。因此未满足CET的基底上，I_P只作本地算子的最小不动点；Herbrand基底满足CET，恢复原书的特例。</p>\n<p>关系解释族现在通过 Str_D 显式装配为完整结构，求值、信息序、下确界及后续超限迭代使用同一种对象类型。默认赋值 d₀ 只补齐公式未使用的变量坐标，不改变 envelope 的值；空族下确界给出同一基底的全矛盾顶结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"签名、有限程序 $P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$、公式 $D_R^P$ 与四值求值分别取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 和 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]]。固定非空集合 $D$、$d_0\\in D$、$I_C:C\\to D$ 以及函数族 $I_F$，其中 $I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D$。这些共同分量在下列全部结构中保持相同。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"签名、有限程序 $P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$、公式 $D_R^P$ 与四值求值分别取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 和 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]]。固定非空集合 $D$、$d_0\\in D$、$I_C:C\\to D$ 以及函数族 $I_F$，其中 $I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D$。这些共同分量在下列全部结构中保持相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"d_0\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"I_C:C\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"I_F","display":false},{"tex":"I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_R\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D_R^P(\\vec x_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Str}_D","display":false},{"tex":"J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"R^M","display":false},{"tex":"M\\sqsubseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"s_{R,\\vec d}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(D_R^P(\\vec x_R))\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_P,\\operatorname{Adequate},I_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)&:=\\prod_{R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}}\\mathsf{Four}^{D^{a_R(R)}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Str}_D(J)&:=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,J\\rangle,\\\\\nK_\\Sigma(D)&:=\\{\\operatorname{Str}_D(J):J\\in\\mathcal I_\\Sigma(D)\\},\\\\\nU&:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\bigl(R\\mapsto(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathsf u)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\mathcal A&:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto\\mathop{\\sqcap}_{M\\in\\mathcal A}R^M(\\vec d)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s_{R,\\vec d}(v):=\\begin{cases}\nd_{\\iota i<a_R(R)\\ (v=x_{R,i})},&v\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R),\\\\\nd_0,&v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x_R).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_P(M)&:=\\operatorname{Str}_D\\left(R\\mapsto\\left(\\vec d\\mapsto⟦D_R^P(\\vec x_R)⟧_{M,s_{R,\\vec d}}\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P&:K_\\Sigma(D)\\to K_\\Sigma(D),\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq N&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M,\\\\\nI_P&:=\\mathop{\\sqcap}\\{M\\in K_\\Sigma(D):\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq M\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E_P(I_P)&=I_P,\\qquad\\forall M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\ (\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)\\to I_P\\sqsubseteq M).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4165,"backlinks":[{"id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的 $P$ 与基底 $D,(c^M),(f^M)$，$M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)$，$U$ 是该基底的全 $\\mathsf u$ 结构。$\\mathcal E_P$ 与 $I_P$ 使用同一基底。$n,m\\in\\omega$；$M_P^{[n]}$ 和 $J_P^n$ 由下式递归引入，不预设 $M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)$。"},{"id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的有限程序 $P$、非空基底 $D$ 及函数、常元解释；$K:=K_\\Sigma(D)$、$U$、$\\mathcal E_P$ 均使用同一基底。$\\sqsubseteq\\subseteq K^2$ 是逐坐标信息序。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-program-envelope|df program envelope]]"},{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的D、函数解释、有限程序P、$K_\\Sigma(D),I_P$；$\\operatorname{Lower}(M)$ 指所有R、⃗d的值均不等于c。A为本语言公式，s为D赋值。$P\\models^{D}_{4}A$ 与 $P\\models^{D}_{\\rm low}A$ 分别量化该固定基底上的全部充分四值、充分lower三值结构。"},{"id":"141c93aa59eed1f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$\\mathsf{pcomp}_\\Sigma(P)$ 和 signed translation 采用 [[72-df-partial-program-completion]]。$\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)$ 是 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 在 $M$ 的自身基底上的前不动点条件；$\\operatorname{Lower}$ 采用 [[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]；$\\vdash^-,\\vdash^-_0$ 采用 [[72-thm-identity-free-cut-elimination]] 的 calculus。"}],"outgoing":["40bb12b12b7a39e7","d9586f246c1c6084","bf103f8baf1db1b8"]}